                      {
                        "id": "run-doctor-in-the-app",
                        "title": "Run doctor in the app",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "prose",
                            "text": "`astryx doctor` checks the whole app, including every package it loaded. `doctor integration validate` checks your package as the app installed it."
