                      [
                        "experimental.xle.components",
                        "Record<string, XleComponent>",
                        "no",
                        "Custom components for the removed layout expander, keyed by component name. The CLI still validates the field, so an entry without a string `from` makes `astryx.config` invalid, but nothing reads it."
                      ]
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "lang": "js",
                    "code": "export default {\n  integrations: ['@acme/astryx-widgets'],\n};",
                    "label": "Minimal"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "lang": "js",
                    "code": "import {appendFileSync} from 'node:fs';\n\nexport default {\n  debug: event => appendFileSync(\"runs.ndjson\", JSON.stringify(event) + \"\\n\"),\n};",
                    "label": "Send every command run somewhere of your own"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "prose",
                    "text": "The config is validated at load with a strict schema: an unknown key, a misspelled one included, or a value of the wrong type makes the whole file invalid. `astryx gap-report`, `astryx discover`, and `astryx upgrade` stop with the error, and `astryx doctor` fails its `config` check (exit 1). Reads such as `component`, `docs`, `search`, `template`, and `theme` carry on silently as if there were no config and no integrations, and no debug handler runs, so run `astryx doctor` after editing the file."
